    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Beats per Minute</strong> is the rhythm of a healthy heart at rest, but be ready to speed it up, chill out, and enjoy the music with <strong>60 BPM</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rhythm game, you play by tapping on-beat with the music by following sound and visual cues, with cute companions and powerful boosters eagerly to assist along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222860/extras/4a3ffa107f2bc7ca567c91c20bcb87c1.avif?t=1748419541\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>- 40 levels across 4 unique visuals and gameplay <br>- 3 very-special levels (you won't be disappointed!)  <br>- 2 difficulty modes and support items to guide your rhythm<br>- Available in 12 languages<br>- Screen ratio and background music customization <br>- Sound delay calibration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your rhythm, enjoy original catchy songs and spectacular surprises on every level, with soothing visuals from the calm of a starry night to the rush of heated battles. Prepare to immerse yourself in the captivating realm of <strong>60 BPM</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Beats per Minute</strong> is the rhythm of a healthy heart at rest, but be ready to speed it up, chill out, and enjoy the music with <strong>60 BPM</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rhythm game, you play by tapping on-beat with the music by following sound and visual cues, with cute companions and powerful boosters eagerly to assist along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222860/extras/4a3ffa107f2bc7ca567c91c20bcb87c1.avif?t=1748419541\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>- 40 levels across 4 unique visuals and gameplay <br>- 3 very-special levels (you won't be disappointed!)  <br>- 2 difficulty modes and support items to guide your rhythm<br>- Available in 12 languages<br>- Screen ratio and background music customization <br>- Sound delay calibration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your rhythm, enjoy original catchy songs and spectacular surprises on every level, with soothing visuals from the calm of a starry night to the rush of heated battles. Prepare to immerse yourself in the captivating realm of <strong>60 BPM</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "60 Beats per Minute is the rhythm of a healthy heart at rest, but be ready to speed it up! Play 43 levels by tapping on-beat with the music following sound and visual cues. Enjoy spectacular surprises, with soothing music and visuals from the calm of a starry night to the rush of heated battles!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Vietnamese",
